#. module: website_sale_one_time_delivery_address
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_sale_one_time_delivery_address.field_sale_order__one_time_delivery
msgid ""
"When enabled, the delivery address created during the website checkout is "
"stored as a temporary contact with type 'one_time_delivery' instead of the "
"standard 'delivery' type. This keeps the recipient out of the customer's "
"regular address book and is useful for reseller orders shipped to an end "
"customer."
msgstr ""

#. module: website_sale_one_time_delivery_address
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_sale_one_time_delivery_address.field_res_partner__allow_dropship
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_sale_one_time_delivery_address.field_res_users__allow_dropship
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_sale_one_time_delivery_address.field_sale_order__allow_dropship
msgid ""
"When enabled, this customer can use the one-time delivery flow during the "
"website checkout: the delivery address is stored as a temporary "
"'one_time_delivery' contact while billing stays on the customer. The one-"
"time delivery option is hidden for customers that do not allow drop-"
"shipping."
msgstr ""
